r_tensorColimit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.HeckeColimitTensorTrace.braidedTower_tensorColimit","kind":"instance","line":276,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/HeckeColimitTensorTrace.lean#L276-L284","doc":"The tensor-model colimit trace is a **braided tower**, with `h = q − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.HeckeColimitTensorTrace.tensorColimitMarkovTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.HeckeColimitTensorTrace.tensorColimitMarkovTrace","kind":"def","line":256,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/HeckeColimitTensorTrace.lean#L256-L274","doc":"**The `IwahoriHecke` tensor-model trace as an abstract `MarkovTrace`**, over any\nfield, at `z = q³/(q²+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.HeckeColimitTensorTrace.trT_markov_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.HeckeColimitTensorTrace.trT_markov_inv","kind":"theorem","line":245,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/HeckeColimitTensorTrace.lean#L245-L254","doc":"**(T3')** Markov stabilisation by the inverse generator; `zinv` is derived from\n`σ⁻¹ = σ − (q − q⁻¹)·1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.HeckeColimitTensorTrace.trT_markov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.HeckeColimitTensorTrace.trT_markov","kind":"theorem","line":224,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/HeckeColimitTensorTrace.lean#L224-L243","doc":"**(T3)** Markov stabilisation on the colimit, with `z = q³/(q²+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.HeckeColimitTensorTr